## Contribution

This files explaing the contribution feature

one saving-jar will have multiple contributions
contributions will be made by users who have access in the saving-jar(owner or partners)
This feature should include making a contribution(Value and Date) and list all contribution made in a saving-jar
contribution can stay in the same module as the saving-jar located in `src/modules/saving-jar`

Contribution Model
    ID
    Value
    Date
    User_id
    SavingJar_ID

